WEBVTT

00:00.940 --> 00:03.310
Man, I'm beat.

00:04.230 --> 00:06.850
Today's quest was tough.

00:08.110 --> 00:10.970
<i>Who knows what would've happened
 if these two hadn't been there?</i>

00:11.760 --> 00:14.870
With my strength, 
protecting Asahi is simple!

00:14.870 --> 00:17.660
But it was <i>my</i> magic 
that dealt the final blow.

00:17.660 --> 00:20.290
All you did was swoop in and 
take the glory, you layabout!

00:20.760 --> 00:22.820
The credit still goes to me.

00:22.820 --> 00:26.130
Oh, right. You did level up 
from that, didn't you, Asahi?

00:27.030 --> 00:29.920
Yeah. I finally reached Level 20.

00:30.180 --> 00:33.260
That's my little brother!
Congrats, Asahi!

00:33.960 --> 00:37.100
I'm still nowhere near a match 
for you or Kilmaria, though.

00:37.530 --> 00:38.180
What is it?

00:37.530 --> 00:38.180
What's wrong?

00:38.640 --> 00:42.180
"Light Magic: Level 1" just
 appeared on my skill tree!

00:42.180 --> 00:43.680
<b>Light Magic</b>

00:42.180 --> 00:43.680
<b>First Aid</b>

00:42.180 --> 00:43.680
I have a Light affinity!

00:43.680 --> 00:44.740
Light?

00:44.740 --> 00:49.080
The energy of this world 
is split into eight types.

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Affinities</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Fire</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Wind</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Ice</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Light</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Water</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Earth</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Lightning</b>

00:46.730 --> 00:52.110
<b>Dark</b>

00:49.080 --> 00:52.110
In my case, Fire and Dark 
are my main affinities.

00:52.110 --> 00:56.920
In RPGs, light affinity is a symbol of
holiness and righteousness.

00:56.920 --> 00:59.700
Tons of main characters 
have it bestowed on them.

00:59.700 --> 01:02.870
Clad in light, driving away
 the wicked darkness...

01:02.870 --> 01:05.770
There isn't a single person 
who wouldn't get fired-up!

01:05.770 --> 01:10.000
Amazing how he can wax lyrical about it 
in front of someone who'd be "driven away."

01:12.670 --> 01:14.200
Everyone, run!

01:14.200 --> 01:16.300
A raging bull has gotten loose!

01:16.300 --> 01:18.800
We've got a live one. 
But we'll soon settle it down.

01:19.670 --> 01:21.730
Both of you, leave this to me.

01:21.730 --> 01:24.410
This is the perfect chance 
to test my new skill.

01:25.310 --> 01:27.690
<b>First Aid</b>

01:25.310 --> 01:28.730
<b>Light Magic</b>

01:25.310 --> 01:28.730
Light Magic: Level 1. Acquired!

01:27.690 --> 01:27.810
<b>First Aid</b>

01:27.810 --> 01:28.730
<b>First Aid</b>

01:31.320 --> 01:36.390
<i>Inside my head... In my mind, the incantation
 which must be spoken is coming to me.</i>

01:38.330 --> 01:40.120
O purest Light,

01:40.120 --> 01:42.080
with your unclouded radiance,

01:42.430 --> 01:45.130
illuminate this darkened world.

01:45.790 --> 01:47.290
Light!

01:48.240 --> 01:49.710
This light is...

01:49.710 --> 01:50.960
Asahi!

02:01.910 --> 02:03.630
Huh? It's literally just light?

