11:16.940 --> 11:19.940
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

11:19.950 --> 11:22.740
Welcome and thank you
for coming, Asahi-sama!

11:22.740 --> 11:26.080
Thank you so much for saving our village!

11:26.700 --> 11:29.200
O-Oh, no, I really didn't do much.

11:29.920 --> 11:34.330
<i>This is the border village that was once 
controlled by the Three Orc Brothers.</i>

11:34.330 --> 11:39.210
<i>I freed them from the orcs. Or to be 
completely accurate, Maya-nee did.</i>

11:39.590 --> 11:43.160
<i>In truth, Maya-nee should be 
receiving this warm welcome, but...</i>

11:43.630 --> 11:49.600
I'll give it a miss. After all, <i>you're</i> the 
hero of that village, Asahi. Go have fun.

11:49.600 --> 11:54.650
And since then, you've achieved even more,
and your name is known in the royal capital!

11:54.650 --> 11:56.310
W-Well, I suppose I have.

11:57.700 --> 12:00.090
Well, well. If it isn't our valiant hero!

12:00.530 --> 12:02.240
I realize this is sudden...

12:02.240 --> 12:05.740
But please, we beg you! 
We have a favor to ask!

12:05.960 --> 12:06.950
Excuse me?

12:06.950 --> 12:10.640
This village is once more 
being targeted by orcs.

12:10.640 --> 12:14.770
Please could you defeat 
the orcs for us again?

12:14.770 --> 12:17.830
We beg your forgiveness 
for seeming to deceive you.

12:17.830 --> 12:24.430
This matter really should go through
 the Guild, but this village is so very poor.

12:24.430 --> 12:27.760
<i>An event flag has triggered 
even though Maya-nee isn't here.</i>

12:27.760 --> 12:29.080
<i>What do I do?</i>

12:30.270 --> 12:33.270
We've got trouble! A group of 
monsters is at the village entrance!

12:33.930 --> 12:36.230
It's time for the mighty hero to shine!

12:36.230 --> 12:38.420
You can do it, Mister Hero!

12:38.420 --> 12:42.520
O mighty hero! O mighty hero! O mighty hero!

12:43.970 --> 12:49.160
R-Right now, we have the one who defeated
 the Three Orc Brothers, Asahi-sama, with us!

12:49.770 --> 12:52.550
G-Go away! Leave immediately!

12:52.550 --> 12:54.580
Oh? Well, this is perfect.

12:54.790 --> 12:57.930
I am the Three Orc Brothers'
 older brother by a different mother.

12:57.930 --> 13:00.670
I will avenge my little brothers.

13:00.670 --> 13:02.260
What a complicated family situation!

13:11.270 --> 13:13.020
<i>The difference in strength is too big.</i>

13:13.020 --> 13:15.810
<i>But if I don't protect them, 
the people of this village will...</i>

13:19.610 --> 13:21.070
Don't!

13:32.550 --> 13:34.320
A-A maid?

13:35.620 --> 13:37.250
Disheveled Moonlight Blossom.

13:40.440 --> 13:42.140
A fighting maid?

13:42.140 --> 13:44.460
Will you continue to observe, Miss?

13:44.680 --> 13:48.390
This is the perfect opportunity to 
ascertain Ikusaba Asahi's true abilities.

13:48.390 --> 13:49.550
However!

13:50.600 --> 13:54.130
If the villagers are in danger, 
we cannot turn a blind eye, Kuon.

13:55.600 --> 13:55.770
<b>Elegant</b>

13:55.600 --> 13:55.770
<b>Elegant</b>

13:55.770 --> 14:01.060
<b>Elegant</b>

13:55.770 --> 14:01.060
<b>Elegant</b>

13:55.870 --> 14:01.080
I, Gloria Brigandine,
 shall defeat them for you!

14:01.080 --> 14:04.880
<i>And now there's a noble-born 
swordswoman? Who are these people?</i>

14:04.880 --> 14:07.900
Who are you two?

14:10.720 --> 14:13.870
I am quite confident when 
it comes to contests of strength.

14:23.450 --> 14:25.170
She's not there. Where'd she go?

14:25.170 --> 14:26.130
Take this!

14:26.880 --> 14:29.760
A single magnificent strike from me!

14:30.390 --> 14:34.920
Elegant Split Buster!

14:39.090 --> 14:42.110
<i>She's unbelievably strong. 
She beat that orc so easily.</i>

14:42.730 --> 14:45.050
<i>Who the heck is this girl?</i>

14:47.450 --> 14:51.890
Ikusaba Asahi. I have heard
 many a rumor about you,

14:51.890 --> 14:54.120
but it seems they truly were all lies.

14:54.620 --> 14:56.870
Y-You know who I am?

14:57.240 --> 15:01.290
You obtained the rank of 
Ogre Class dishonestly, did you not?

15:02.410 --> 15:06.470
Judging by your movements 
earlier, it is plain to see.

15:06.470 --> 15:10.050
The true you is as weak as a field rabbit.

15:10.260 --> 15:14.720
You cannot fool the eyes
 of Gloria Brigandine!

15:14.720 --> 15:18.980
<i>Th-This is bad! The fact that 
I'm weak has been completely exposed!</i>

15:18.980 --> 15:21.020
Now, confess!

15:21.980 --> 15:22.970
A rock?

15:24.730 --> 15:26.570
That's not true.

15:26.910 --> 15:29.530
Mister Hero is really strong!

15:29.930 --> 15:31.060
Anne-chan...

15:31.750 --> 15:33.070
I see.

15:33.070 --> 15:36.480
Deceiving such an innocent young girl
 makes you all the more wicked!

15:36.960 --> 15:40.190
Now that it has come to this, 
I will cross swords with you,

15:40.190 --> 15:42.570
and open everyone's eyes to the truth!

15:50.800 --> 15:52.130
Miss! Fall back!

16:03.290 --> 16:04.730
<i>What swordsmanship.</i>

16:04.730 --> 16:08.150
<i>Does this mean he was 
concealing his true strength?</i>

16:08.150 --> 16:11.110
<b>The person panicking the most internally</b>

16:08.500 --> 16:11.130
<i>Wh-Wh-What just happened?</i>

16:21.360 --> 16:25.170
Y-You dare to embarrass me like this?

16:25.170 --> 16:29.140
N-No, that was because of 
what that maid did, right?

16:28.170 --> 16:29.590
<b>Nope</b>

16:29.970 --> 16:31.520
This means a duel!

16:31.920 --> 16:34.800
A duel in front of everyone in an arena!

16:34.800 --> 16:39.970
There, I shall ascertain your 
true strength, Ikusaba Asahi!

16:39.970 --> 16:41.470
What?!

16:42.180 --> 16:46.120
<i>This is an RPG thing! 
I triggered an arena event?!</i>

16:46.560 --> 16:47.980
A duel, huh?

16:47.980 --> 16:50.620
Now, what to do about this?

16:53.780 --> 16:55.740
A Few Days Later

16:53.780 --> 16:55.740
The Day of the Duel

16:58.410 --> 17:00.800
I hear you're dueling Gloria-san!

17:00.800 --> 17:03.210
I'll bring Roy along to watch.

17:03.210 --> 17:07.750
Calling the Exalted Hero a rank-falsifying,
cannon fodder adventurer! She must be blind!

17:07.750 --> 17:10.260
Please make this 
Gloria-sama person understand.

17:10.260 --> 17:12.270
You get to fight someone strong.

17:12.270 --> 17:15.560
Instead of going pale like that,
 you should be proud!

17:15.990 --> 17:20.040
The young lady from the House of Brigandine is 
a fierce Golem Class fighter, but do your best.

17:20.040 --> 17:23.410
Hm? Yup, I said Golem Class.

17:23.930 --> 17:25.390
How did it end up like this?

17:25.390 --> 17:30.820
<b>Prodigy</b>

17:25.390 --> 17:30.820
<b>Enforcer of</b>

17:25.390 --> 17:30.820
<b>Justice</b>

17:25.390 --> 17:30.820
<b>Ikusaba Asahi</b>

17:25.780 --> 17:27.850
The daughter of a patron of the Guild,

17:27.850 --> 17:30.820
who's a swordswoman that
 assesses adventurers' abilities?

17:30.820 --> 17:33.470
And this is the first I've heard
 of her being Golem Class!

17:33.470 --> 17:36.250
That's third from the top, 
under God and Dragon Class.

17:36.660 --> 17:38.200
She's quite the fighter.

17:38.200 --> 17:42.870
If I fight her head-on, I'll just 
end up like that orc half-brother.

17:42.870 --> 17:45.040
What am I supposed to do?!

17:45.040 --> 17:46.440
Calm down, Asahi.

17:46.440 --> 17:50.440
If I back you up with magic from the shadows
 like I usually do, it should be all right.

17:50.440 --> 17:53.360
But if I just keep relying 
on you, Maya-nee...

17:53.360 --> 17:55.380
And with so many people watching, too.

17:55.380 --> 17:58.620
When you're in a tight spot,
you should rely on your sister.

17:58.620 --> 18:01.770
You are getting stronger, Asahi. 
No doubt about it.

18:01.770 --> 18:03.920
Have more confidence in yourself.

18:04.470 --> 18:06.560
Y-You think so?

18:11.470 --> 18:13.290
Just leave it to your big sister!

18:21.580 --> 18:26.580
Now, Ikusaba Asahi, you will allow me
 to ascertain your true strength!

18:26.580 --> 18:30.700
<i>I will fight as much as 
I can using my own strength.</i>

18:31.740 --> 18:34.000
Will Asahi be all right?

18:34.000 --> 18:37.210
The girl he's facing is 
a tough opponent, isn't she?

18:37.210 --> 18:41.210
It's not a problem. If things get bad,
 we've agreed I'll support him from here.

18:41.210 --> 18:42.850
What a relief.

18:42.850 --> 18:45.750
Calm down. What good will it
 do for you to be nervous?

18:48.010 --> 18:49.310
This girl...

18:49.310 --> 18:51.480
Gloria's maid.

18:51.920 --> 18:53.170
You're quite perceptive.

19:04.780 --> 19:06.910
<i>Maya-nee, where's my support?</i>

19:14.280 --> 19:16.270
What's wrong, Ikusaba Asahi?

19:16.270 --> 19:18.590
If you do not attack, you cannot win.

19:18.590 --> 19:22.200
<i>What do I do? Can I win without Maya-nee?</i>

19:24.050 --> 19:25.030
Asahi!

19:25.420 --> 19:27.220
Now that it's come to this, <i>I'll</i> save him!

19:30.560 --> 19:32.230
Th-This intimidating force...

19:32.580 --> 19:38.570
How insolent. A paltry human dares 
to turn their intent to kill on me?

19:39.320 --> 19:41.060
Don't, Kilmaria.

19:41.060 --> 19:44.200
Are you sure? At this rate, Asahi will...

19:44.200 --> 19:45.990
Didn't you know?

19:45.990 --> 19:48.700
My little brother always 
surpasses expectations.

19:49.100 --> 19:51.750
Graceful Strike!

19:56.220 --> 19:57.710
You just refuse to stand still.

19:57.710 --> 19:59.490
Why do you not attack?

20:00.050 --> 20:03.670
<i>Gloria must have a weakness. 
I have to find it, no matter what.</i>

20:07.460 --> 20:12.810
<i>Oh, that's right! Gloria mistakenly 
thinks Maya-nee's attack was mine.</i>

20:13.070 --> 20:15.040
<i>That's why she's being so wary.</i>

20:15.650 --> 20:19.610
<i>If I aim for that opening, 
I should be able to see a way through!</i>

20:19.610 --> 20:22.150
I will defeat you before you defeat me!

20:25.160 --> 20:29.830
Elegant Split Buster!

20:29.830 --> 20:30.750
There!

20:34.290 --> 20:35.500
Flash!

20:40.040 --> 20:42.310
A-A blinding technique?

20:42.310 --> 20:43.580
That will not...

20:46.410 --> 20:47.990
This duel is over.

20:56.690 --> 20:59.310
You bested me without a
 single swing of your sword.

21:00.580 --> 21:03.280
Why did you not attack me?

21:03.530 --> 21:04.900
Why?

21:09.600 --> 21:11.640
I can't raise my sword against a girl.

21:18.630 --> 21:19.630
Gloria?

21:20.770 --> 21:23.500
I-I admit defeat this time.

21:24.050 --> 21:27.550
One day, w-we shall meet again.

21:30.440 --> 21:32.520
One day, huh?

21:32.890 --> 21:36.040
Looks like I've become 
acquainted with another odd girl.

23:08.970 --> 23:10.440
You did it, Asahi!

23:10.440 --> 23:14.980
That was magnificent! 
You won without needing any help at all!

23:15.690 --> 23:16.830
It went really well.

23:16.830 --> 23:18.430
Listen to this, Asahi!

23:18.430 --> 23:22.040
Kilmaria got so worried, she nearly 
forced her way into the duel and—

23:22.040 --> 23:23.920
Don't tell him that!

23:24.130 --> 23:25.990
How dare you interrupt me so violently!

23:25.990 --> 23:29.400
This is perfect! Let's have our own duel
 to settle things once and for all!

23:29.400 --> 23:33.930
Don't go triggering 
another tournament event!

23:35.810 --> 23:36.860
<b>Next Time</b>

23:36.230 --> 23:38.930
Next time: "The Preferred
 Form of a Big Sister."

23:36.900 --> 23:37.070
<b>Episode 9</b>

23:37.190 --> 23:41.230
<b>Episode 9</b>

23:37.520 --> 23:41.230
<b>The Preferred Form of a Big Sister</b>
